# Sieve: RFC 5228 (Sieve: An Email Filtering Language); requirements/languages/sieve.md
name     sieve siv
keyword  require if elsif else stop keep discard redirect fileinto reject vacation anyof allof not
keyword  header address envelope size exists true false
builtin  :is :contains :matches :over :under :all :localpart :domain
ident-part     :
line-comment   #
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
string   text: .
sigil    :    : attr
operators  [],;{}
